    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8715221a2a9b1fd484e7840e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『――啊，命运之星！我要感谢你！\n我是何等的幸运之人！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "5518a4de6c22f19bdbcdafe8717d16fce3838e2da446dd250344a13a1ae2f74e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        88,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/88/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3f5b09471bfe35bf6ac786d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想到能成为训练员的这份幸运，\n甚至让这样喜剧的一段台词\n在脑海中闪过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48f416ae196223e47c826279eff650ae12419e5e34d7ee0635b99a5c14d9137d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        89,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/89/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:459d0d004abd748b59c59775",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "遥远的未来，相连前方的荣冠……。\n如果能做这样的梦，\n真想永远沉睡下去――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40a4ef9b2b3d55c6537d59617e3d0fff747141399d222cf9fa4e7aeaa5903aff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b3985da08bdda4d453777a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fea14373030f77fe59b8e828b607a745b9576347d4420757e783504fbaf52ab2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
