      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不是。回想起来您从前来发掘我时起\n就是个热情洋溢的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0fdb7e9ea8d9460a8019e70c2a7fa4e296b9b2aca50a7b49b03f566ee002a28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
