      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "沿夜路飞奔而来――在黄色聚光灯下，\n气势几乎要让我当场跪倒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c90016b4e02612bcd225702719a3cca3e4aed72daf7516099e7f53cda079901",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
