      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "培养，让她获胜，再培养并再次获胜。\n在这循环的尽头――",
      "source_fingerprint": "28f049411e5d370f75901dc39189d9d45502741e1f7b7a61a3fbb418694cd75c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
